# EXPECT-SUBSTRING: ValueTuple
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
# `tuple()` (dang rong) PHAI bi tu choi o BIEN DICH.
#
# Do khac biet KIEN TRUC giua TokenVector va Python: `tuple` cua Python la
# container bien do dai, con TokenVector dung `System.ValueTuple<T1..TN>` -
# VALUE TYPE co so phan tu co dinh 2..7, biet luc bien dich (`il_tupleN_type`
# tu choi N < 2). Nen `tuple()` rong (arity 0) khong bieu dien duoc.
#
# Neu compiler "cho qua" va tra ve thu gi do, ket qua se sai - nen phai bao
# loi ro, kem goi y cach viet thay the. File nay khong the chay de kiem tra
# vi no PHAI bien dich that bai - xem quy tac nay trong Testkit/negative/.
def run() -> "i32":
    t = tuple()
    print(str(t))
    return 0